      "canonical_url": "https://www.tavus.io/blog/magic-canvas-lets-a-conversation-finish-what-it-starts",
      "title": "Magic Canvas Lets A Conversation Finish What It Starts",
      "summary": "Magic Canvas gives every PAL a shared, interactive canvas inside the conversation. The PAL brings up the right component at just the right moment, a chart dynamically drawn from the numbers being discussed, a question answered on the spot, a calendar with times to pick, a field for the detail that must be exact. Whatever the person does with it, the PAL sees it instantly and responds in real time, so seeing what it means and getting things done happen in the same place the talking always has. The interface finally follows the conversation, instead of the other way around.",
